# HubSpot chat widget (HubSpot Conversations) — the same drop-in chat
# climatiq.io uses. Set this to YOUR HubSpot Portal (Hub) ID to enable the
# chat bubble. Leave it empty to disable the widget.
#
# Where to find your Portal ID:
#   HubSpot → Settings (gear icon) → Account Management → Account Defaults
#   (it's also the number in the embed snippet under
#    Settings → Tracking & Analytics → Tracking Code, e.g.
#    //js.hs-scripts.com/XXXXXXXX.js)
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and put your real ID there.
VITE_HUBSPOT_PORTAL_ID=
